{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Reform the system for NHS clinical negligence claims and cases",
        "additional_details": "The Government should implement the following reforms: create a national panel of medical experts that assess all clinical negligence cases, establish a dedicated, independent body to investigate concerns regarding experts\u2019 evidence and introduce meaningful sanctions against expert witnesses found guilty of deliberately misrepresenting medical evidence or failing to meet their professional duties.",
        "background": "We call on the Government tot introduce urgent reforms to the system regarding NHS clinical negligence claims and cases to ensure that patients who have suffered avoidable life-changing injuries receive a fair, transparent and independent investigation.",
